---
import Money from "./Money.astro";
---
<div>
 <form data-op="budgets:savePlan" data-transform="plan" class="plan-grid">
  <section class="panel"><h2>Monthly spending</h2><fieldset>
   <div data-show="funded" hidden><p>Income is planned in the shared budget. Your personal allocation is <span data-text="personalIncoming"></span> for this month.</p></div>
   <div data-show="ownIncome"><Money name="expectedIncome" label="Expected take-home income"/></div>
   <div data-list="limits"></div><template data-row="limits"><div><Money name="limit" label="Category limit"/></div></template>
   <div class="divider"></div><Money name="savingsTarget" label="Monthly savings target"/>
   <p class="muted">Category limits repeat next month. Allocate all available money, then save your budget.</p>
  </fieldset></section>
  <aside class="panel green plan-summary"><p class="eyebrow">THE BIG PICTURE</p><h2>Money available to plan</h2><strong class="big-number" data-plan-available></strong>
   <dl>{[["Expected income","income"],["Incoming budget funding","incoming"],["Carry-forward","carry"],["Outgoing budget funding","outgoing"],["Spending limits","limits"],["Savings target","target"],["Left to allocate","balance"]].map(([label,key])=><div class={key==="balance"?"total":""}><dt>{label}</dt><dd {...{[`data-plan-${key}`]:""}}></dd></div>)}</dl>
   <p data-plan-hint></p><button type="submit">Save budget</button><p data-message role="alert"></p>
  </aside>
 </form>
 <section class="panel" data-show="people" hidden><h2>Personal budget funding</h2><p>Assign a monthly amount to each personal budget. It reduces shared funding and is available at once. No bank transfer is needed.</p><p class="muted">Both partners can change these amounts. Personal spending and transactions stay private. After a change, balance and save the affected budgets.</p><div data-list="people"></div>
  <template data-row="people"><form class="inline-form" data-op="personalAllocations:save" data-money="amount"><fieldset><Money name="amount" label="Personal amount"/><button type="submit">Save amount</button><p data-message role="alert"></p></fieldset></form></template>
 </section>
 <button class="secondary" type="button" data-op="budgets:repeatPlan" data-show="repeat" data-success="Limits copied. Open next month to finish and save your budget.">Copy limits to <span data-text="nextMonth"></span></button>
</div>
